<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 15.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 15.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   106/108   113/115     UNQ     213/214</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  111/113   117/120   225/230   245/248</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker levels on Wednesday saw further losses as the market is awash with supplies, traders said. A major said he sold a parcel of 380-cst at $111.75 and offers were still edging lower as bids were scarce. Traders said prices may break the $110 mark for 380-cst by Thursday.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
